    <p>
      We may update these Terms from time to time without prior notice.
      The "Last updated" date at the top of this page indicates when the
      Terms were most recently revised. Continued use of RepMaths after
      changes means you accept the updated Terms.
    </p>

    <h2>Termination</h2>

    <p>
      We reserve the right to restrict or terminate access to RepMaths
      for any user who violates these Terms or uses the website in a way
      that is harmful to RepMaths, its infrastructure, or other users.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>

    <p>
      If you have questions about these Terms, please visit our
      <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </article>

  <style>
    .legal-page {
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .legal-page h2 {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .legal-page ul {
      color: #c7cbd2;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      padding-left: 20px;
      margin: 12px 0;
    }

    .legal-page li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .legal-page p {
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .legal-page a {
      color: var(--accent);
    }
  </style>
</Base>
